sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  actor Manager
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Stripe

  Customer->>API: Submit inquiry and alternate dates
  Manager->>API: Create itinerary, price, terms, option hold
  API->>DB: Reserve vessel/resource option range
  API-->>Customer: Versioned expiring proposal
  Customer->>API: Accept proposal
  API->>DB: Validate option and freeze order lines
  API->>Stripe: Create full-payment intent
  Stripe->>API: Verified success webhook
  API->>DB: Convert option to confirmed reservations and booking
  alt Option invalid at acceptance
    API-->>Customer: Expired proposal, no charge
  end
